{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828710/extras/4d2e61aca32b0f745e889a659ef10d80.avif?t=1772631504\" width=780 height=165 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are William, a soldier of the Grande Arm\u00e9e brought back from a battlefield grave. But the Europe you awaken to is not the one you sacrificed for. A mysterious plague now sweeps the continent, and you have been reborn with its corrupting power pulsing through your veins.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828710/extras/3285ac753a07a8070e9c7289de559a8c.avif?t=1772631504\" width=780 height=133 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828710/extras/1f273b0f18feb4f59d88960f217685de.poster.avif?t=1772631504\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828710/extras/1f273b0f18feb4f59d88960f217685de.webm?t=1772631504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828710/extras/1f273b0f18feb4f59d88960f217685de.mp4?t=1772631504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each death is a chance to grow stronger. Master a combat system of parries, dashes, and visceral finishers across a variety of weapons. Channel your power to enhance attacks and unlock new supernatural abilities to inflict upon your enemies.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828710/extras/af900e204940ebc01dd7343137838692.avif?t=1772631504\" width=780 height=133 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828710/extras/f1c079143221c5821d29d1d53dfc2baa.poster.avif?t=1772631504\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828710/extras/f1c079143221c5821d29d1d53dfc2baa.webm?t=1772631504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828710/extras/f1c079143221c5821d29d1d53dfc2baa.mp4?t=1772631504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a 19th-century alternate history where the costs of endless war have corrupted the landscape. Use your newfound mobility to outmaneuver the plague-ridden abominations of Napoleon\u2019s Eternal Guard and uncover environmental secrets that may increase your chances of survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828710/extras/d596e9c488fae182baddcf2baefd6978.avif?t=1772631504\" width=780 height=133 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828710/extras/d4f402ddb3004aaf0d2d38e9f011e464.poster.avif?t=1772631504\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828710/extras/d4f402ddb3004aaf0d2d38e9f011e464.webm?t=1772631504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828710/extras/d4f402ddb3004aaf0d2d38e9f011e464.mp4?t=1772631504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness a compelling story where historical figures and realities intertwine with elements of horror and the supernatural. Explore beyond the dark corners of the world to discover the truth behind the plague and your unholy resurrection.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828710/extras/b562c1b65dea1dd20f53e3cfdc2a4897.avif?t=1772631504\" width=780 height=306 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2828710?t=1772631504","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828710/977f12b1748a3901b6d967dd099f2d40692d8974/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772631504","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828710/c845c26a71524fa38b25c3b3da23a384de7d1436/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772631504","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828710/c845c26a71524fa38b25c3b3da23a384de7d1436/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772631504","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Gameplay is focused around combat in a brutal wartorn landscape. Players are exposed to violence throughout the game."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828710/extras/4d2e61aca32b0f745e889a659ef10d80.avif?t=17726